From: Xiake Sun <xiake.sun@amd.com>
Date: Fri, 31 Jul 2026 02:15:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat (MHA): Optimize MiMo FP8 page-64 batch prefill with a
 head-192 CK specialization
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Add the validated (192,96) FP8/BF16 batch-prefill tile for MiMo’s head-192, vectorized page-64 KV cache via a temporary CK patch.
- Restrict dispatch to the exact supported contract, preserve the padded head-256 fallback, add AITER coverage for non-contiguous pages, ragged contexts, numerical accuracy, and fully written outputs.

Signed-off-by: Xiake Sun <xiake.sun@amd.com>
